#: source/features/imitation-learning/augmented_imitation.rst:4
msgid "Augmented Imitation Learning"
msgstr "增强模仿学习"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/augmented_imitation.rst:6
msgid ""
"This section describes how to use Isaac Lab's imitation learning "
"capabilities with the visual augmentation capabilities of `Cosmos "
"<https://www.nvidia.com/en-us/ai/cosmos/>`_ models to generate "
"demonstrations at scale to train visuomotor policies robust against visual "
"variations."
msgstr ""
"本节描述了如何使用 Isaac Lab 的模仿学习功能，结合 `Cosmos <https://www.nvidia.com/en-"
"us/ai/cosmos/>`_ 模型的视觉增强功能，以生成大规模演示以训练对抗视觉变化的视觉动作策略。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/augmented_imitation.rst:10
msgid ""
"The `Cosmos Transfer1 <https://github.com/nvidia-cosmos/cosmos-"
"transfer1/tree/e4055e39ee9c53165e85275bdab84ed20909714a>`_ model used in "
"this tutorial is `supported <https://huggingface.co/nvidia/Cosmos-"
"Transfer1-7B#software-integration>`_ on Ampere and Hopper GPUs."
msgstr ""
"本教程使用的 `Cosmos Transfer1 <https://github.com/nvidia-cosmos/cosmos-"
"transfer1/tree/e4055e39ee9c53165e85275bdab84ed20909714a>`_ 模型 `支持 "
"<https://huggingface.co/nvidia/Cosmos-Transfer1-7B#software-integration>`_ "
"Ampere 和 Hopper GPU。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/augmented_imitation.rst:13
msgid "Generating Demonstrations"
msgstr "生成演示"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/augmented_imitation.rst:15
msgid ""
"We use the Isaac Lab Mimic feature that allows the generation of additional "
"demonstrations automatically from a handful of annotated demonstrations."
msgstr "我们使用 Isaac Lab Mimic 功能，该功能允许从少数标注的演示中自动生成额外演示。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/augmented_imitation.rst:18
msgid ""
"This section assumes you already have an annotated dataset of collected "
"demonstrations. If you don't, you can follow the instructions in "
":ref:`teleoperation-imitation-learning` to collect and annotate your own "
"demonstrations."
msgstr ""
"本节假设您已经有一个收集到的演示数据集。如果没有，您可以按照 :ref:`teleoperation-imitation-learning` "
"中的说明来收集和标注您自己的演示。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/augmented_imitation.rst:20
msgid ""
"In the following example, we will show you how to use Isaac Lab Mimic to "
"generate additional demonstrations that can be used to train a visuomotor "
"policy directly or can be augmented with visual variations using Cosmos "
"(using the ``Isaac-Stack-Cube-Franka-IK-Rel-Visuomotor-Cosmos-Mimic-v0`` "
"environment)."
msgstr ""
"在以下示例中，我们将向您展示如何使用 Isaac Lab Mimic 生成额外的演示，这些演示可直接用于训练视觉运动策略，或者可以使用 Cosmos "
"进行视觉变化增强（使用 ``Isaac-Stack-Cube-Franka-IK-Rel-Visuomotor-Cosmos-Mimic-v0`` "
"环境）。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/augmented_imitation.rst:23
msgid ""
"The ``Isaac-Stack-Cube-Franka-IK-Rel-Visuomotor-Cosmos-Mimic-v0`` "
"environment is similar to the standard visuomotor environment (``Isaac-"
"Stack-Cube-Franka-IK-Rel-Visuomotor-Mimic-v0``), but with the addition of "
"segmentation masks, depth maps, and normal maps in the generated dataset. "
"These additional modalities are required to get the best results from the "
"visual augmentation done using Cosmos."
msgstr ""
"``Isaac-Stack-Cube-Franka-IK-Rel-Visuomotor-Cosmos-Mimic-v0`` "
"环境类似于标准的视觉动作环境（ ``Isaac-Stack-Cube-Franka-IK-Rel-Visuomotor-Mimic-v0`` "
"），但在生成的数据集中添加了分割蒙版、深度图和法线图。这些额外的模态是使用 Cosmos 进行视觉增强时获得最佳结果所必需的。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/augmented_imitation.rst:0
msgid "uv (Recommended)"
msgstr "uv（推荐）"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/augmented_imitation.rst:0
msgid "isaaclab.sh / isaaclab.bat"
msgstr "isaaclab.sh / isaaclab.bat"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/augmented_imitation.rst:45
msgid ""
"The number of demonstrations can be increased or decreased, 1000 "
"demonstrations have been shown to provide good training results for this "
"task."
msgstr "展示的数量可以增加或减少，1000 个展示已被证明能够为此任务提供良好的训练结果。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/augmented_imitation.rst:47
msgid ""
"Additionally, the number of environments in the ``--num_envs`` parameter can"
" be adjusted to speed up data generation. The suggested number of 10 can be "
"executed on a moderate laptop CPU. On a more powerful desktop machine, use a"
" larger number of environments for a significant speedup of this step. When "
"running large camera-heavy jobs, switch to the RTX Minimal renderer for "
"higher throughput, or override the task's high-fidelity RTX settings "
"directly if they are more expensive than your workflow requires."
msgstr ""
"还可以调整 ``--num_envs`` 中的环境数量，加快数据生成。建议值 10 可在性能中等的笔记本 CPU "
"上运行；性能更强的台式机可增加环境数，显著加快此步骤。运行大量依赖相机的任务时，可切换到 RTX Minimal 渲染器来提高吞吐量；如果任务的高保真 "
"RTX 设置超出工作流需求，也可直接覆盖这些设置。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/augmented_imitation.rst:55
msgid "Cosmos Augmentation"
msgstr "Cosmos 增强"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/augmented_imitation.rst:58
msgid ""
"The ``hdf5_to_mp4.py`` and ``mp4_to_hdf5.py`` scripts below read and write "
"MP4 files through OpenCV's video I/O, which requires ffmpeg support. Recent "
"Isaac Sim releases ship an OpenCV build without ffmpeg, so install the full "
"OpenCV package into the environment before running these conversions:"
msgstr ""
"下面的 ``hdf5_to_mp4.py`` 和 ``mp4_to_hdf5.py`` 脚本通过 OpenCV 视频 I/O 读写 MP4 文件，需要 "
"FFmpeg 支持。近期 Isaac Sim 版本附带的 OpenCV 构建不包含 FFmpeg，因此转换前需在环境中安装完整 OpenCV 包："

#: source/features/imitation-learning/augmented_imitation.rst:76
msgid ""
"Without it, the conversion scripts fail to open or write the video files."
msgstr "否则，转换脚本将无法打开或写入视频文件。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/augmented_imitation.rst:79
msgid "HDF5 to MP4 Conversion"
msgstr "HDF5 到 MP4 转换"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/augmented_imitation.rst:81
msgid ""
"The ``hdf5_to_mp4.py`` script converts camera frames stored in HDF5 "
"demonstration files to MP4 videos. It supports multiple camera modalities "
"including RGB, segmentation, depth and normal maps. This conversion is "
"necessary for visual augmentation using Cosmos as it only works with video "
"files rather than HDF5 data."
msgstr ""
"``hdf5_to_mp4.py`` 脚本将存储在 HDF5 示范文件中的摄像头帧转换为 MP4 视频。它支持多种摄像头模式，包括 "
"RGB、分割、深度和法线图。使用 Cosmos 进行视觉增强时，此转换是必要的，因为它仅适用于视频文件而不是 HDF5 数据。"

