msgstr "生成 prompts 数量（默认值: 1）。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/augmented_imitation.rst:195
msgid "``--output_path``"
msgstr "``--output_path``"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/augmented_imitation.rst:196
msgid ""
"Path to the output file to write generated prompts. (default: prompts.txt)"
msgstr "生成 prompts 写入的输出文件路径。 (默认值: prompts.txt)"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/augmented_imitation.rst:204
msgid ""
"In case you want to create your own prompts, we suggest you refer to the "
"following guidelines:"
msgstr "如果您想要创建自己的 prompts，则建议您参考以下准则: "

#: source/features/imitation-learning/augmented_imitation.rst:206
msgid ""
"Keep the prompts as detailed as possible. It is best to have some "
"instruction on how the generation should handle each visible object/region "
"of interest. For instance, the prompts that we provide cover explicit "
"details for the table, lighting, background, robot arm, cubes, and the "
"general setting."
msgstr ""
"尽量详细地保留 prompts。最好对生成过程中每个可见对象/感兴趣区域都有一些指导。例如，我们提供的 prompts "
"涵盖了桌子、灯光、背景、机械臂、立方体和整体布景的细节。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/augmented_imitation.rst:208
msgid ""
"Try to keep the augmentation instructions as realistic and coherent as "
"possible. The more unrealistic or unconventional the prompt is, the worse "
"the model does at retaining key features of the input control video(s)."
msgstr "尽量使增强指令尽可能地真实和连贯。模型在保留输入控制视频的关键特征方面做得越不真实或不传统，它的表现就越糟糕。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/augmented_imitation.rst:210
msgid ""
"Keep the augmentation instructions in-sync for each aspect. What we mean by "
"this is that the augmentation for all the objects/regions of interest should"
" be coherent and conventional with respect to each other. For example, it is"
" better to have a prompt such as \"The table is of old dark wood with faded "
"polish and food stains and the background consists of a suburban home\" "
"instead of something like \"The table is of old dark wood with faded polish "
"and food stains and the background consists of a spaceship hurtling through "
"space\"."
msgstr ""
"保持每个方面的增强指令同步。我们的意思是，所有感兴趣对象/区域的增强应彼此协调一致并符合常规。例如，使用诸如 \"The table is of old"
" dark wood with faded polish and food stains and the background consists of "
"a suburban home\" 这样的提示，要好于 \"The table is of old dark wood with faded "
"polish and food stains and the background consists of a spaceship hurtling "
"through space\" 这样的提示。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/augmented_imitation.rst:212
msgid ""
"It is vital to include details on key aspects of the input control video(s) "
"that should be retained or left unchanged. In our prompts, we very clearly "
"mention that the cube colors should be left unchanged such that the bottom "
"cube is blue, the middle is red and the top is green. Note that we not only "
"mention what should be left unchanged but also give details on what form "
"that aspect currently has."
msgstr ""
"在输入控制视频的关键方面，必须包括应保留或保持不变的细节。在我们的 prompts "
"中，我们非常明确地提到立方体的颜色应保持不变，使得底部立方体是蓝色，中间是红色，顶部是绿色。请注意，我们不仅提到了应该保持不变的内容，还详细说明了该方面当前的形式。"

