#: source/features/imitation-learning/augmented_imitation.rst:332
msgid "``--output_file``"
msgstr "``--output_file``"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/augmented_imitation.rst:271
msgid "Path to save the new HDF5 file with augmented videos."
msgstr "保存新的带有增强视频的 HDF5 文件的路径。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/augmented_imitation.rst:274
msgid ""
"The input HDF5 file is used to preserve the non-visual data (such as robot "
"states and actions) while replacing the visual data with the augmented "
"versions."
msgstr "输入 HDF5 文件用于保留非视觉数据（例如机器人状态和动作），同时用增强版本替换视觉数据。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/augmented_imitation.rst:277
msgid ""
"The visually augmented MP4 files must follow the naming convention "
"``demo_{demo_id}_*.mp4``, where:"
msgstr "视觉增强的 MP4 文件必须遵循命名约定 ``demo_{demo_id}_*.mp4`` ，其中: "

