msgid "``demo_id`` matches the demonstration ID from the original MP4 file"
msgstr "``demo_id`` 匹配原始 MP4 文件中的演示 ID"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/augmented_imitation.rst:281
msgid ""
"``*`` signifies that the file name can be as per user preference starting "
"from this point"
msgstr "``*`` 表示文件名可以根据用户的偏好从此处开始。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/augmented_imitation.rst:283
msgid ""
"This naming convention is required for the script to correctly pair the "
"augmented videos with their corresponding demonstrations."
msgstr "这种命名惯例是为了让脚本能够正确地将增强视频与相应的演示配对。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/augmented_imitation.rst:308
msgid "Pre-generated Dataset"
msgstr "预生成的数据集"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/augmented_imitation.rst:310
msgid ""
"We provide a pre-generated dataset in HDF5 format containing visually "
"augmented demonstrations for the cube stacking task. This dataset can be "
"used if you do not wish to run Cosmos locally to generate your own augmented"
" data. The dataset is available on `Hugging Face "
"<https://huggingface.co/datasets/nvidia/PhysicalAI-Robotics-Manipulation-"
"Augmented>`_ and contains both (as separate dataset files), original and "
"augmented demonstrations, that can be used for training visuomotor policies."
msgstr ""
"我们提供了一个预先生成的数据集，其中包含了用于立方体堆叠任务的视觉增强演示，格式为 HDF5。 如果您不希望在本地运行 Cosmos "
"来生成自己的增强数据，可以使用此数据集。 该数据集位于 `Hugging Face "
"<https://huggingface.co/datasets/nvidia/PhysicalAI-Robotics-Manipulation-"
"Augmented>`_ ，包含原始和增强演示（作为单独的数据集文件），可用于训练视觉动作策略。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/augmented_imitation.rst:313
msgid "Merging Datasets"
msgstr "合并数据集"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/augmented_imitation.rst:315
msgid ""
"The ``merge_hdf5_datasets.py`` script combines multiple HDF5 datasets into a"
" single file. This is useful when you want to combine the original "
"demonstrations with the augmented ones to create a larger, more diverse "
"training dataset."
msgstr ""
"``merge_hdf5_datasets.py`` 脚本将多个 HDF5 "
"数据集合并为单个文件。当您希望将原始演示与增强演示合并以创建更大、更多样化的训练数据集时，这将非常有用。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/augmented_imitation.rst:323
msgid "``--input_files``"
msgstr "``--input_files``"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/augmented_imitation.rst:324
msgid "A list of paths to HDF5 files to merge."
msgstr "将要合并的 HDF5 文件路径列表。"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/augmented_imitation.rst:333
msgid "File path to merged output. (default: merged_dataset.hdf5)"
msgstr "合并输出的文件路径。（默认值: merged_dataset.hdf5）"

#: source/features/imitation-learning/augmented_imitation.rst:336
msgid ""
"Merging datasets can help improve policy robustness by exposing the model to"
" both original and augmented visual conditions during training."
msgstr "合并数据集可以通过在训练过程中使模型接触原始和增强的视觉条件，从而帮助提高政策的稳健性。"

